     v-Pendiente AT ROW 1.48 COL 55 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 4 NO-TAB-STOP 
     v-importependiente AT ROW 1.48 COL 63 COLON-ALIGNED NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 6 NO-TAB-STOP 
     v-hat AT ROW 1.48 COL 98 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 14 NO-TAB-STOP 
     v-cdg_cobrador AT ROW 2.67 COL 13 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 42
