          "Fecha de la rendición" WIDGET-ID 44
          LABEL "Fecha Cobro"
          BGCOLOR 15 FGCOLOR 9 
     v-cdg_administrador AT ROW 3.86 COL 13 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 26
     v-dsc_administrador AT ROW 3.86 COL 28 COLON-ALIGNED HELP
          "Denominacion" NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 28 NO-TAB-STOP 
     t-Cambio AT ROW 5.52 COL 56 WIDGET-ID 48 NO-TAB-STOP 
     BROWSE-1 AT ROW 6.71 COL 1.6 WIDGET-ID 200
     b-cancela AT ROW 3.86 COL 124 WIDGET-ID 12
     b-lista AT ROW 2.67 COL 124 WIDGET-ID 10 NO-TAB-STOP 
     b-ninguno AT ROW 5.43 COL 22 WIDGET-ID 38
     B-TODO AT ROW 5.43 COL 4.6 WIDGET-ID 34
     bVer-2 AT ROW 3.86 COL 100 WIDGET-ID 32 NO-TAB-STOP 
     RECT-4 AT ROW 1.24 COL 1 WIDGET-ID 20
     RECT-7 AT ROW 1.24 COL 121 WIDGET-ID 22
    WITH 1 DOWN NO-BOX KEEP-TAB-ORDER OVERLAY 
         SIDE-LABELS NO-UNDERLINE THREE-D 
         AT COL 1 ROW 1
         SIZE 146.4 BY 24.67 WIDGET-ID 100.


